   * When `confirmRemoveFromCase` is true, how to ask for confirmation:
   * - **`dialog`** (default) — in-widget **`swim-dialog`** from `swim-ui.js` (same design system as ngx-ui modals; no Angular `DialogService`).
   * - **`native`** — blocking `window.confirm` (opt-in only).
   *
   * Custom Turbine widgets are **not** Angular components: `@swimlane/ngx-ui` **`DialogService`** / `ng-template` cannot run here.
   */
  removeConfirmPresentation: 'dialog',
  /**
   * When true (default), fetch full enterprise ATT&CK from `mitreStixJsonUrl` for the picker (all TTPs MITRE ships in that bundle).
   * When false, picker uses an empty embedded catalog (offline / air-gapped — no tactics until STIX is enabled or data exists on the record).
